    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the forward cargo door surround corner region, showing the four aluminium-lithium corner fittings, their alloy steel attachment set and the frame web assembly they are bolted to.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of the forward cargo door surround corner region, from the frame web assembly outward to the four corner fittings and their attaching hardware.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the left-hand side looking outboard; the right-hand side is symmetrically opposite and is not drawn separately. Sheet 2 shows the fastener pattern at the lower forward corner. Item 20 is the corner fitting, four off, and is common to every aircraft in the effectivity. The attachment set at items 30 and 40 is the tension-head bolt with a plain washer under the head and is used at all four corners."
    },
